  "description": "Saint Helena island individual tax residence for tax year 2026 (1 April 2026 to 31 March 2027). Covers the three section 2 tests (more than 90 days with a normal abode, more than 183 days, a contract of at least 183 days), arrival and departure, the one-tenth travel discretion, the source rule, and where the official leaflet conflicts with the statute. Use for residence, days on island or part-year allowance questions on St Helena. Does not apply to Ascension or Tristan da Cunha.",
